            ^"Abilities" STRING "[Native Language] 5, Awareness 2 (attentive), Bargain 1 (music), Brawl 1 (fist), Carouse 2 (coarse songs), Charm 3 (sweet words), Covenant Lore 3 (history), Enchanting Music 6+2 (love), Etiquette 2 (covenants), Faerie Lore 1 (fabulous tales), Folk Ken 1 (magi), Guile 3 (elaborate lies), Intrigue 2 (magi), Latin 4 (Hermetic use), Leadership 2 (grogs), Legerdemain 3 (nimble fingers), Magic Lore 2 (fabulous tales), Music 4 (wide knowledge), Order of Hermes Lore 2 (history), Ride 1 (mule)"
