            ^"Abilities" STRING "[Surrounding Area] Lore 2 (geography), Artes Liberales 1 (grammar), Athletics 3 (jump), Awareness 4 (at night), Bargain 1 (food), Brawl 2 (claws), Covenant Lore 1 (people), Guile 1 (wily words), Hunt 4 (mice), Latin 5 (Hermetic use), [Magus’s] Language 5 (orders), Second Sight 3 (invisible things), Stealth 4 (stalking), Survival 3 (forests) ( A familiar gains the magus’s ability in any languages he speaks.)"
